{"id":"5e5e9d27f0e20f58","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-core-model-covering.md","title":"ZFC Core Model Covering","display":"df-zfc-core-model-covering — ZFC Core Model Covering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-core-model-covering","aliases":["58-df-zfc-core-model-covering"],"display":"df-zfc-core-model-covering — ZFC Core Model Covering","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-core-model-covering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-core-model-covering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-core-model-covering — ZFC Core Model Covering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model\">58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (class parameter) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\\)</span> (transitive ZFC class-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"150182b44c47c043\" href=\"?note=150182b44c47c043\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model\">58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoreModelCovering}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoreModelCovering}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}covering} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoreModelCovering}_S(K,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl((X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land|X|&lt;\\kappa)\\to \\exists Y\\in K\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\land |Y|&lt;\\kappa)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}covering} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoreModelCovering}_S(K,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl((X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land|X|&lt;\\kappa)\\to \\exists Y\\in K\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\land |Y|&lt;\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom states the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-covering property for a transitive definable class model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> of ZFC.</li>\n<li>The class-model condition is inherited from the canonical transitive-class-model predicate, avoiding an unsourced class-level satisfaction expression and the false declaration <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in V\">\\(K\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model","status":"resolved","id":"150182b44c47c043","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model","status":"resolved","id":"150182b44c47c043","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S$ (transitive ZFC class-model predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}$ (cofinality function, see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoreModelCovering}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}covering} \\vdash \\mathrm{CoreModelCovering}_S(K,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl((X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land|X|<\\kappa)\\to \\exists Y\\in K\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\land |Y|<\\kappa)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in V","display":false}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1777","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-core-model-covering.md|58-df-zfc-core-model-covering]]（batch06）